{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/230543-victorian-mage","id":230543,"title":"Victorian Mage","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-08-16T14:26:10-07:00","id":230543,"title":"Victorian Mage","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <b>May 2015</b><br /><br /> <span style=\"color:#444444\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><b>MTAs \u2013 Victorian Mage</b>: This book will cover the Victorian era with as much detail and respect for sources as <b>Victorian Age: Vampire</b>. <b>VA: Mage</b> will cover 1880 to 1897, building on the foundation of the Order of the Golden Dawn, and revealing the foundation of the modern Technocracy. <i>320 pages. PDF/PoD/Possible Deluxe Edition.</i></span></span></span> </div> </div> </div>You may now begin screaming. I know I am.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-16T15:03:32-07:00","id":230597,"title":"","content":"And that's a thicker book than Victorian Age: Vampire...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://darker-days.org/\" target=\"_blank\">Darker Days Radio</a> - The World of Darkness Podcast<br /> <a href=\"http://historylessons.libsyn.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Unbuttoned History</a> - A History Podcast with Jokes","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/124-darker-days-mike","name":"Darker Days Mike","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar124_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"134"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-16T15:22:47-07:00","id":230612,"title":"","content":"I just want confirmation that it will be heavy in discussion of colonialism and the non-European Tradition Mages ready to utterly forsake any association with their Western Counterparts (Chakravanti vs. Order of the Black Willow; Vishnudharadhara vs. Christian Chorusters, Sahajiya vs. Hellfire Clubs, Dreamspeakers vs everyone)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-16T15:49:24-07:00","id":230625,"title":"","content":"Well, that kills my little fan project stone dead... looking forward to it though...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/373-infernal-teddy","name":"Infernal Teddy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar373_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"51"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-16T17:17:06-07:00","id":230710,"title":"","content":"Well we're actually going to have an official book set during the time of the Grand Reorganization of the Order of Reason into the Technocratic Union... Okay, they got my money.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://youtu.be/_yBS2EZFduI?t=2m13s\" target=\"_blank\">Homo sapiens. What an inventive, invincible species. It's only a few million years since they crawled up out of the mud and learned to walk. Puny, defenceless bipeds. They've survived flood, famine and plague. They've survived cosmic wars and holocausts. And now, here they are, out among the stars, waiting to begin a new life. Ready to outsit eternity. They're indomitable. Indomitable.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/420-akatsukileader13","name":"AkatsukiLeader13","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar420_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1637"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-16T20:55:15-07:00","id":230956,"title":"","content":"I knew that 24 percent raise would come in handy. Now shut up and take my money!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&quot;</span>Explanations exist; they have existed for all time; there is always a well-known solution to every human problem \u2014 neat, plausible, and wrong.<span style=\"font-size:14px\">&quot;<br /> - H.L. Mencken</span></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/467-bob-the-skull","name":"Bob the Skull","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar467_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"71"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-16T21:40:50-07:00","id":231005,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/230543-victorian-mage?p=230612#post230612\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I just want confirmation that it will be heavy in discussion of colonialism and the non-European Tradition Mages ready to utterly forsake any association with their Western Counterparts (Chakravanti vs. Order of the Black Willow; Vishnudharadhara vs. Christian Chorusters, Sahajiya vs. Hellfire Clubs, Dreamspeakers vs everyone)</div> </div> </div> </div>Not only that - I really hope that this time authors would describe at length countries beyond &quot;anglo-saxon axis&quot;, like such Technocracy friendly state as Bismark's Germany.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3479-von-lyttenburgh","name":"von Lyttenburgh","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3479_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"159"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-16T23:30:13-07:00","id":231097,"title":"","content":"If we get any wordcount at all thrown at a description of Awakened society in Victorian Hong Kong, I'll have received my money's worth.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-17T08:25:45-07:00","id":231524,"title":"","content":"Please, let me bear your babies, Onyx.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cI am absolute, I am perfect, I am supreme. I shall be eternal. My tragedy, is that there is no other fate for me. My powerlessness was that I couldn\u2019t subjugate my journey to the gods, while dreaming of rebirth at the end of distant time, like other pharaohs.\u201d Ramesses II, Fate/Prototype: Argent Fragments.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2918-kat","name":"Kat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2918_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1762"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-17T13:35:27-07:00","id":231915,"title":"","content":"I just wish they would expand the timeline a bit so they could cover things like the Opium Wars, but this should mean they should be able to cover such figures as Jack the Ripper (1888).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;The only consistent wisdom is in knowing you know nothing&quot; ~ Socrates <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://i.imgur.com/PbrO9Kq.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1197-imthestein","name":"Imthestein","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1197_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"238"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-17T15:02:16-07:00","id":232003,"title":"","content":"Now here is something that I been wanting for a long time. So this makes me really happy. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1381-herkles","name":"herkles","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"325"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-17T23:30:10-07:00","id":232498,"title":"","content":"I assume we can expect the Progenitors of the era (or equivalent, there are a couple of names they've been called in the era by different books I think), are going to be dominated by unabashed racist Eugenicists? The Ivory Tower and [Syndicate] will be equally well wed to the eugenicists via Social Darwinism?<br /> <br /> Socialism exists of course and is the only major voice in the era against the idea that poverty and social problems are caused by in-born failures as opposed to external oppression, but it's still an anti-establishment resistance cause, so not one that's going to have pull amongst Technocrat elites. That won't change until the Bolsheviks shape it into an ideology of Statist control, and it can catch the NWO's eye. As a modernist secularist paradigm, it likely has some Technocrat support, but they'd be a hunted minority seen as Craftmasons resurgent.<br /> <br /> Just my off hand thoughts...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":1098,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","user":"glamourweaver","date":". 08-18-2014, 06:03 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-18T02:19:12-07:00","id":232619,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> As a modernist secularist paradigm, it likely has some Technocrat support, but they'd be a hunted minority seen as Craftmasons resurgent. </div> </div> </div>I find it more plausible they'd just be ignored. No need to rock the boat further while restructuring.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/downloads/Backer%20Badge%20small.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/178-michael","name":"Michael","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar178_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3560"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-18T09:49:32-07:00","id":232918,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/230543-victorian-mage?p=232498#post232498\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I assume we can expect the Progenitors of the era (or equivalent, there are a couple of names they've been called in the era by different books I think), are going to be dominated by unabashed racist Eugenicists? The Ivory Tower and [Syndicate] will be equally well wed to the eugenicists via Social Darwinism?<br /> .</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, it's the World of Darkness, so shouldn't they be WORSE than they were in the real world? (Shudder)<br /> <br /> It's going to be an interesting tightrope to walk. Presenting the darkness of that time without wading in the ick and offending scads of people. There was a lot of good stuff about the Victorian era too. Unfortunately, some of THAT went bad as well down the line...<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1062-ajax","name":"Ajax","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1062_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2319"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-18T20:29:49-07:00","id":233696,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ajax</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/230543-victorian-mage?p=232918#post232918\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Well, it's the World of Darkness, so shouldn't they be WORSE than they were in the real world? (Shudder)<br /> <br /> It's going to be an interesting tightrope to walk. Presenting the darkness of that time without wading in the ick and offending scads of people. There was a lot of good stuff about the Victorian era too. Unfortunately, some of THAT went bad as well down the line...</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Speaking for myself I'd be much more offended by white-washing away the realities of eugenics, social-darwinism, and imperialism - rather than including them. Including doesn't mean endorsing after all: The goal should actually be to critically spot-light those elements.<br /> <br /> Speaking tangentially to Victorian academics, this is the era of the myth of white Grecian marbles was invented, and the era of &quot;restoring&quot; medieval Churches by removing any hint of their murals in favor of the &quot;grandeur&quot; of plain white edifices. Here's a good blog post on Western chromophobia and its Victorian roots, and why &quot;Victorian Restoration&quot; is an oxymoron for architecture nerds and archeologists: <a href=\"http://medievalpoc.tumblr.com/post/72762204600/re-chromophobia-of-course-these-chromophobes\" target=\"_blank\">http://medievalpoc.tumblr.com/post/7...e-chromophobes</a><br /> <br /> It's very thematic to the Technocratic Union - rewriting history not through objective research, but through a belief in what they see as &quot;rational&quot; and &quot;clean&quot; - with all the attendant imperialist baggage that goes with it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-18T23:40:56-07:00","id":233912,"title":"","content":"<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/230543-victorian-mage?p=233696#post233696\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> <br /> It's very thematic to the Technocratic Union - rewriting history not through objective research, but through a belief in what they see as &quot;rational&quot; and &quot;clean&quot; - with all the attendant imperialist baggage that goes with it.</div> </div> </div> </div><span style=\"font-family:courier new\">Imperial Sehnsucht ?</span><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:8px\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\">&lt;signature&gt; something witty &lt;/signature&gt;</span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/302-nazfool","name":"Nazfool","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar302_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"753"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-19T00:27:18-07:00","id":233931,"title":"","content":"I'm not sure what &quot;inconsolable longing&quot; (closest English translation) has to do with it...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-19T05:44:36-07:00","id":234090,"title":"","content":"It will be interesting to see the Traditions and Conventions at this point in time as A) no one is holding the Seat of Matter, meaning we only have eight Traditions, B) the Ahl-i-Batin are still a Tradition and C) the early SoE and VA are still members of the Technocracy.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://youtu.be/_yBS2EZFduI?t=2m13s\" target=\"_blank\">Homo sapiens. What an inventive, invincible species. It's only a few million years since they crawled up out of the mud and learned to walk. Puny, defenceless bipeds. They've survived flood, famine and plague. They've survived cosmic wars and holocausts. And now, here they are, out among the stars, waiting to begin a new life. Ready to outsit eternity. They're indomitable. Indomitable.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/420-akatsukileader13","name":"AkatsukiLeader13","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar420_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1637"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-19T10:11:08-07:00","id":234352,"title":"","content":"And running their &quot;computers&quot; on steam engines.<br /> <br /> Assuming the game will be pinned with London as the center (which makes sense since that's where the Union is a-building), it will be interesting to see a lot of the Traditions as being tied to particular &quot;subject nations of the Empire&quot;. Probably much more of a focus on Dreamspeakers representing the &quot;savages&quot; of Australia and Africa, the Euthanatos/Chakravanti and Cultists from India, the Ahl-i-Batin representing the Middle East, the Akashics as Chinese... with all the attendant racism and noblesse oblige imaginable....<br /> <br /> I wonder if we're going to see some info on places like the American &quot;Old West&quot; as well? Probably too much to ask in a first book beyond a cursory fashion....","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1062-ajax","name":"Ajax","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1062_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2319"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-19T16:46:09-07:00","id":234803,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AkatsukiLeader13</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/230543-victorian-mage?p=234090#post234090\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It will be interesting to see the Traditions and Conventions at this point in time as A) no one is holding the Seat of Matter, meaning we only have eight Traditions, B) the Ahl-i-Batin are still a Tradition and C) the early SoE and VA are still members of the Technocracy.</div> </div> </div> </div>If the final product draws heavily on <a href=\"http://rpgbooks.wikia.com/wiki/Victorian_Age:_Mage_Rulebook/Outline\" target=\"_blank\">Ian Watson's old outline</a>, the Traditions and Conventions proper might end up more in the background, with some of the more historically/culturally appropriate factions taking center stage. I haven't seen enough information to know how much of an influence (if any) that outline has on current plans, though.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&quot;</span>Explanations exist; they have existed for all time; there is always a well-known solution to every human problem \u2014 neat, plausible, and wrong.<span style=\"font-size:14px\">&quot;<br /> - H.L. Mencken</span></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/467-bob-the-skull","name":"Bob the Skull","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar467_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"71"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-19T16:49:22-07:00","id":234808,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ajax</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/230543-victorian-mage?p=234352#post234352\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I wonder if we're going to see some info on places like the American &quot;Old West&quot; as well? Probably too much to ask in a first book beyond a cursory fashion....</div> </div> </div> </div>I don't really expect the final product to expand a lot on what was said in a couple of the <i>Werewolf: The Wild West</i> books. <i>Victorian Age: Vampire</i> also brought in the Enlightened Society of the Weeping Moon, so I won't be shocked if they show up again.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&quot;</span>Explanations exist; they have existed for all time; there is always a well-known solution to every human problem \u2014 neat, plausible, and wrong.<span style=\"font-size:14px\">&quot;<br /> - H.L. Mencken</span></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/467-bob-the-skull","name":"Bob the Skull","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar467_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"71"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-19T16:57:53-07:00","id":234811,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ajax</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/230543-victorian-mage?p=234352#post234352\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">And running their &quot;computers&quot; on steam engines.<br /> <br /> Assuming the game will be pinned with London as the center (which makes sense since that's where the Union is a-building), it will be interesting to see a lot of the Traditions as being tied to particular &quot;subject nations of the Empire&quot;. Probably much more of a focus on Dreamspeakers representing the &quot;savages&quot; of Australia and Africa, the Euthanatos/Chakravanti and Cultists from India, the Ahl-i-Batin representing the Middle East, the Akashics as Chinese... with all the attendant racism and noblesse oblige imaginable....<br /> <br /> I wonder if we're going to see some info on places like the American &quot;Old West&quot; as well? Probably too much to ask in a first book beyond a cursory fashion....</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> One idea I had tinkering with the setting is that several of the Seats of the more diverse Traditions on the Council of Nine (actually Eight, no one occupies the Seat of Matter) are currently in the hands of Europeans - white Christian Chorusters, Order of the Black Willow for the Euthanatos, Acharne Hellfire Clubs for the Ecstatics. Combine that with the Verbena and the Order of Hermes, and you have a solid majority block of votes.<br /> <br /> Actually didn't the Dreamspeakers walk in this era? Leaving it down to Council of Seven, with groups like Chakravanti, Sahajiya, Madzimbabwe, Righteous Ghazi, Vishnudharadhara, etc etc no longer acknowledging the leadership of their Council representatives or seeing themselves as being part of the same Traditions as their European counterparts.<br /> <br /> The Ahl-i-Batin and Akashics are externally doing what they can to save the dream of the Council, but internally verging on walking themselves (as the Ahl-i-Batin eventually do).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-19T17:14:57-07:00","id":234820,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Bob the Skull</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/230543-victorian-mage?p=234803#post234803\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> If the final product draws heavily on <a href=\"https://&amp;quot;&#91;url\" target=\"_blank\">http://rpgbooks.wikia.com/wiki/Victorian_Age:_Mage_Rulebook/Outline&amp;quot;]Ian</a> Watson's old outline[/URL], the Traditions and Conventions proper might end up more in the background, with some of the more historically/culturally appropriate factions taking center stage. I haven't seen enough information to know how much of an influence (if any) that outline has on current plans, though.</div> </div> </div> </div>I hope this product draws heavily on the outline; the Lodges are fascinating and I like that approach far more than the Traditions as a whole.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-19T17:51:14-07:00","id":234838,"title":"","content":"If that's like outline it will convince even my OWoD-skeptic colleague if it's like NWoD theme wise.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cI am absolute, I am perfect, I am supreme. I shall be eternal. My tragedy, is that there is no other fate for me. My powerlessness was that I couldn\u2019t subjugate my journey to the gods, while dreaming of rebirth at the end of distant time, like other pharaohs.\u201d Ramesses II, Fate/Prototype: Argent Fragments.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2918-kat","name":"Kat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2918_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1762"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-19T18:55:47-07:00","id":234904,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/230543-victorian-mage?p=234820#post234820\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I hope this product draws heavily on the outline; the Lodges are fascinating and I like that approach far more than the Traditions as a whole.</div> </div> </div> </div>I can go either way, but I do like the Lodge concept - and it's not as if it abandons the &quot;meta-organizations,&quot; it just focuses more on local/regional manifestations and supposes a limited degree of coordination.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&quot;</span>Explanations exist; they have existed for all time; there is always a well-known solution to every human problem \u2014 neat, plausible, and wrong.<span style=\"font-size:14px\">&quot;<br /> - H.L. Mencken</span></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/467-bob-the-skull","name":"Bob the Skull","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar467_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"71"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-19T21:46:32-07:00","id":235045,"title":"","content":"Do we know who will be the developer of this project?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/317-james_willoughby","name":"James_Willoughby","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar317_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-19T23:38:24-07:00","id":235117,"title":"","content":"I wonder what the status of the Electrodyne Engineers/Sons of Ether will be? Will this be a convention in flux, with part of the convention defecting to the Council of Nine, and some members remaining with the Technocracy?<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1078-froggy711","name":"Froggy711","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1078_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"314"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-20T02:10:12-07:00","id":235219,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Froggy711</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/230543-victorian-mage?p=235117#post235117\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I wonder what the status of the Electrodyne Engineers/Sons of Ether will be? Will this be a convention in flux, with part of the convention defecting to the Council of Nine, and some members remaining with the Technocracy?<br /></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I'd time the rise of the Electrodyne Engineers as a full fledged Convention to 1893, when Tesla announces the possibility of wireless energy transfer to the world. This is following them falling out with the other Methodologies of the International Brotherhood of Mechanists (future Iteration X) over the course of the 1880s (as reflected in, or as reflecting*, Tesla's relationship with Edison).<br /> <br /> *It is not my intent to state either are, or are not Awakened. Mage understanding of history is intentionally ambiguous as to whether they are shaping Sleeper events, or whether their politics are simply shaped by Sleeper paradigmatic conflicts.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-03T23:18:41-08:00","id":823103,"title":"","content":"An interesting age to be explored, and a good time for adventures about the myths of Chulthu.<br /> <br /> . And I don't mind Alan Moore's opinion, I &quot;enjoyed like a dwarf&quot; the movie of &quot;Leage of Extraordinary Getlemen&quot;.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Tell me what you brag and I will tell you what you lack&quot; (Spanish saying)<br /> <br /> \u00abThe Master Confucius said: \u201cThe noble man is in harmony but does not follow the crowd. The inferior man follows the crowd, but is not in harmony\u201d\u00bb (Anaclet 13:23)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11152-luis-carlos","name":"Luis Carlos","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11152_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"258"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-15T14:52:19-08:00","id":830526,"title":"","content":"And now everybody here should go watch Showtime's &quot;Penny Dreadful&quot; (particularly season 2). Thank you.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1392-bennett","name":"Bennett","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1392_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-15T14:59:33-08:00","id":830532,"title":"","content":"Arise necro thread arise!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3953-dwight","name":"Dwight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3953_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2355"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-21T22:35:47-08:00","id":834844,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AkatsukiLeader13</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/230543-victorian-mage?p=230710#post230710\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well we're actually going to have an official book set during the time of the Grand Reorganization of the Order of Reason into the Technocratic Union... Okay, they got my money.</div> </div> </div> </div>you know numerous books say that happened in 1851 and not the late 1800's, which seems to be when many people think it happened.<br /> <br /> I know the union went through ANOTHER reorganization in the late 1800's as well though<br /> <br /> Just a friendly quip.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3148-zennis","name":"Zennis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3148_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"414"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-21T22:45:14-08:00","id":834851,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/230543-victorian-mage?p=233696#post233696\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Speaking for myself I'd be much more offended by white-washing away the realities of eugenics, social-darwinism, and imperialism - rather than including them. Including doesn't mean endorsing after all: The goal should actually be to critically spot-light those elements.<br /> <br /> Speaking tangentially to Victorian academics, this is the era of the myth of white Grecian marbles was invented, and the era of &quot;restoring&quot; medieval Churches by removing any hint of their murals in favor of the &quot;grandeur&quot; of plain white edifices. Here's a good blog post on Western chromophobia and its Victorian roots, and why &quot;Victorian Restoration&quot; is an oxymoron for architecture nerds and archeologists: <a href=\"http://medievalpoc.tumblr.com/post/72762204600/re-chromophobia-of-course-these-chromophobes\" target=\"_blank\">http://medievalpoc.tumblr.com/post/7...e-chromophobes</a><br /> <br /> It's very thematic to the Technocratic Union - rewriting history not through objective research, but through a belief in what they see as &quot;rational&quot; and &quot;clean&quot; - with all the attendant imperialist baggage that goes with it.</div> </div> </div> </div>Remember that Francis Galton, the founder of Eugenics, psychometrics, meteorology and several other fields (he was co founder of the field of genetics along with his cousin Charles Darwin and also forensic science), WAS AGAINST RACISM AND FOR JEWISH RIGHTS!<br /> <br /> Ironically the founder of eugenics was against anti semitism, extreme nationalism, elitism, many but not all forms of racism, sexism and non democratic government (though he was racist towards Africans).<br /> <br /> He would be rolling in his grave if he knew what Hitler did to his fine work!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3148-zennis","name":"Zennis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3148_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"414"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-22T00:03:43-08:00","id":834868,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Zennis</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/230543-victorian-mage?p=834851#post834851\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Remember that Francis Galton, the founder of Eugenics, psychometrics, meteorology and several other fields (he was co founder of the field of genetics along with his cousin Charles Darwin and also forensic science), WAS AGAINST RACISM AND FOR JEWISH RIGHTS!<br /> <br /> Ironically the founder of eugenics was against anti semitism, extreme nationalism, elitism, many but not all forms of racism, sexism and non democratic government (though he was racist towards Africans).<br /> <br /> He would be rolling in his grave if he knew what Hitler did to his fine work!</div> </div> </div> </div>You do realize you are responding to a post from two years ago, right?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3953-dwight","name":"Dwight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3953_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2355"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-22T22:31:29-08:00","id":835608,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Zennis</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/230543-victorian-mage?p=834851#post834851\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Remember that Francis Galton, the founder of Eugenics, psychometrics, meteorology and several other fields (he was co founder of the field of genetics along with his cousin Charles Darwin and also forensic science), WAS AGAINST RACISM AND FOR JEWISH RIGHTS!<br /> <br /> Ironically the founder of eugenics was against anti semitism, extreme nationalism, elitism, many but not all forms of racism, sexism and non democratic government (though he was racist towards Africans).<br /> <br /> He would be rolling in his grave if he knew what Hitler did to his fine work!</div> </div> </div> </div>Hitler didn't appear out of a vacuum. The Victorian period through the first half of the 20th Century was sterilizing the poor and disabled, classifying racial hierarchies of intelligence, pouring toxic showers on immigrants, holding &quot;fitter family&quot; competitions, etc etc etc.<br /> <br /> Galton explicitly believed in getting rid &quot;undersirables&quot; and multiplying &quot;desirables&quot; - the fact that he didn't classify Jews on his list of undesirables like Hitler did, does not make the eugenics era any less of a continuous parade of horrors, inseparable from Social Darwinism and Imperialism, long before the Third Reich.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":1098,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","user":"glamourweaver","date":". 02-23-2016, 01:34 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-23T19:02:08-08:00","id":836149,"title":"","content":"Do we know if Victorian Mage is still happening, or does Paradox's &quot;One World of Darkness&quot; plan Vaporwear it?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-23T19:15:45-08:00","id":836155,"title":"","content":