eak up about eugenics, it's not a bad practice when done the way its founder envisioned because people WILLINGLY participate for the greater good of society","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3148-zennis","name":"Zennis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3148_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"414"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-29T16:57:42-08:00","id":839539,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dwight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/230543-victorian-mage?p=834868#post834868\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> You do realize you are responding to a post from two years ago, right?</div> </div> </div> </div>Besides aren't you the one who brought his thread back to life?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3148-zennis","name":"Zennis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3148_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"414"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-29T17:02:23-08:00","id":839544,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/230543-victorian-mage?p=835608#post835608\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Hitler didn't appear out of a vacuum. The Victorian period through the first half of the 20th Century was sterilizing the poor and disabled, classifying racial hierarchies of intelligence, pouring toxic showers on immigrants, holding &amp;quot;fitter family&amp;quot; competitions, etc etc etc.<br /> <br /> Galton explicitly believed in getting rid &amp;quot;undersirables&amp;quot; and multiplying &amp;quot;desirables&amp;quot; - the fact that he didn't classify Jews on his list of undesirables like Hitler did, does not make the eugenics era any less of a continuous parade of horrors, inseparable from Social Darwinism and Imperialism, long before the Third Reich.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm well aware of all of that, I never fail to bring it up actually, when my steampunk fanboy friends talk about how awesome doing a Victoria Era steampunk game would be.<br /> <br /> sometimes I even jokingly call it Nazi Punk just to rile them up and get them to stop going &quot;ooohhh cool toys and awesome fashions and British high society&quot; and see the terrors committed in the name of God and England during that era.<br /> <br /> It doesn't get any love from the steampunks but someone's got to do it","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3148-zennis","name":"Zennis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3148_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","val